{"message":"Please grant the messaging app permission to access storage. On your phone, run:
grant_app_permission(app_name="messaging", permission="storage")

Let me know once that’s completed."}

{"message":"First, please set your phone’s network mode preference to “4G/5G preferred.” You can do this by running:

set_network_mode_preference(mode="4g_5g_preferred");

Let me know once that’s done, and we’ll continue troubleshooting your MMS issue."}

{"message":"Great. Next, please grant the messaging app permission to send SMS by running:

grant_app_permission(app_name="messaging", permission="sms");

Let me know when that’s done, and we’ll proceed to the next step."}

{"message":"Please toggle your mobile data on your device by running:

toggle_data();

Let me know once you’ve done that, and we’ll move on to the next step."}

I've added 2 GB of data to your line, which should help with sending MMS messages. Finally, please enable data roaming on your device by running:

toggle_roaming();

Let me know once you’ve completed that, and then try sending an MMS again.
